// Feature 4 variant: Inline embedded INSIDE a nested embedded block.
// Source shape: legend-engine TestRelationalGrammarRoundtrip#testEmbeddedRelationalMapping,
//   which nests `contractId() Inline[TEST_Id]` inside `prop1WithEmbedded ( ... )`.
// Verified here as parses AND compiles.
###Pure
Class demo::Address { name: String[1]; }
Class demo::Firm { legalName: String[1]; address: demo::Address[1]; }
Class demo::Person { firstName: String[1]; firm: demo::Firm[1]; }
###Relational
Database demo::db
(
  Table T (ID INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, FN VARCHAR(200), LN VARCHAR(200), AN VARCHAR(200))
)
###Mapping
Mapping demo::M
(
  demo::Person[p]: Relational
  {
    scope([demo::db]T)
    (
      firstName: FN,
      firm
      (
        legalName: LN,
        address() Inline[addr1]
      )
    )
  }
  demo::Address[addr1]: Relational
  {
    name: [demo::db]T.AN
  }
)
